sequenceDiagram
    participant R as REPL
    participant PC as Project Config
    participant AS as AI Session Manager
    participant CM as Context Manager
    participant TM as Thread Manager
    participant AP as AI Port
    participant SP as Storage Port
    participant C as Claude Adapter
    participant FS as File System

    %% Initial session creation
    R->>PC: Load project config
    PC->>SP: Read config
    SP->>FS: Load EDN
    FS-->>SP: Config data
    SP-->>PC: Config
    PC-->>R: Loaded config

    %% Start AI session
    R->>AS: Create session
    AS->>CM: Get initial context
    CM->>SP: Load system prompts
    SP->>FS: Read prompts EDN
    FS-->>SP: Prompt data
    SP-->>CM: System prompts
    CM-->>AS: Initial context
    AS->>TM: Create thread
    TM->>SP: Store new thread
    SP->>FS: Write thread EDN
    AS-->>R: Session ready

    %% Send message
    R->>AS: Send message
    AS->>TM: Add to thread
    TM->>CM: Get current context
    CM-->>TM: Context + prompts
    TM->>AP: Send to AI
    AP->>C: API request
    C-->>AP: API response
    AP-->>TM: AI response
    TM->>SP: Update thread
    SP->>FS: Write updated EDN
    TM-->>AS: Updated thread
    AS-->>R: AI response